---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="content-container about-section">
  <SectionHeading
    number="01"
    title="About the Competition"
  />

  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      The <strong>Daniel H. Plotnick Memorial Computing Competition (DHPMCC)</strong> is an in-person competitive programming tournament hosted at <strong>Bergen County Academies</strong> in Hackensack, New Jersey.
    </p>
    <p>
      Competitors work individually through a series of original algorithmic problems, developing and implementing solutions within fixed time and memory constraints. The competition emphasizes problem solving, algorithmic reasoning, and efficient implementation.
    </p>
    <p>
      DHPMCC is held in memory of Daniel H. Plotnick, honoring his contributions to mathematics, computing, and the students he inspired.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: #374151;
    margin: 0.95rem auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
